                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17835363" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Tue, 9 Apr 2024 12:03:40 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Two incremental dictionaries are generated based on the same existing dictionary, and then the dictionaries are merged without checking, resulting in dictionary problems.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17835366" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Tue, 9 Apr 2024 12:06:29 +0000"  >&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Design&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Design&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Generate an incremental dictionary based on the snapshot version of an existing dictionary, and record that version.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;When merging the dictionary, compare the version of the existing dictionary with the one just recorded,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;if they are inconsistent, revoke this step and retry,&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;if they are consistent, merge the dictionary normally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
